+
+# Rental availability query
+
+Add `availability(query)` to the rental service, where `query` is `{ start, end, kind? }`. It returns the ids of the equipment of that kind (any kind when `kind` is omitted) that is free for the whole period, sorted.
+
+- The period follows the same rules as `quote` and `book` (UTC midnight, `end` after `start`); an invalid period throws.
+- Free means no booking overlaps the period; back-to-back bookings do not overlap.
+- An unknown `kind` throws.
